The question decks in this directory (questions.json, questions.csv) and in
the ../sets/ files are released under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal
public domain dedication. Use them for anything, with or without attribution.
Full text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Each question links to a public source for the underlying fact. Those sources
keep their own copyrights; only the question wording, options, and notes are
dedicated to the public domain here.
